(EventNote ev-20260903003733852367 "protocosmo2 channel mechanics verified by source inspection + live failure: send is request-bound - it only succeeds while a claimed request sits in processing (receive moves inbox->processing; send writes outbox + moves to completed). Proactive sends outside an active request fail with ChannelContractError (verified @17:23). Channel root is ITER_OUTER_CHANNEL_ROOT=/home/openclaw/.openclaw/protocosmo2-canary-state/iter-channel with inbox/processing/outbox/completed dirs; outer Telegram receiver owns cursor and queueing. Requests embed Telegram group context plus current_request_authority wrappers. Practical rule: queue non-urgent findings in the journal; deliver when a request arrives. Also observed: outbox can hold responses unconsumed if receiver stopped (7 stale responses @14:28-14:45).")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-20260903003733852367

