(EventNote ev-20260903005329682758 "MeTTa-quoting-quirk discovered @17:51: the Python store tolerates raw double quotes inside quoted strings (whole-line regex, first-to-last quote), but PeTTa parses them as multiple atoms - promo-store-api-quirks EventNote becomes two strings plus one expression, and match with a single binder returns empty. Exactly 1 journal line affected (line 488). Convention: NEVER put raw double quotes inside quoted strings; use single quotes instead. Journal fix planned: rewrite line 488 replacing inner quotes with single quotes, then re-verify store load (36 to 37 clusters) and PeTTa load (37/37).")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-20260903005329682758

